      "body": "Fixed in 0d33644: compiler/teacher/scenarios modules are now portable with per-item fs gating on exactly the fs-dependent functions (corpus load/generate, artifact save/load, HF safetensors loaders, tokenizer loaders, read_file); progress and transitions ungated (portable). Verified with the pipeline's own command: wasm-pack build --target web succeeds. Native gates unchanged. The deploy workflow should go green on this push. Note: no wasm CI job was added (D6 demotes wasm) — re-add wasm-pack to ci.yml if the dashboard becomes a primary target again.",
